ocol Negotiation) support.\"},{\"charStart\":30026,\"charEnd\":30276,\"text\":\"Deprecated alias for zlib.bytesWritten. This original name was chosen because it also made sense to interpret the value as the number of bytes read by the engine, but is inconsistent with other streams in Node.js that expose values under these names.\"},{\"charStart\":30474,\"charEnd\":30491,\"text\":\"Some previously s\"}],\"sourcePath\":\"C:\\\\Temp\\\\weftmate-fact1-9128ff3e-23cd-46bd-acab-e185dc459c0d\\\\profile\\\\conversations\\\\6e44798d8f34f6fb001e664ccbeeae98db3be11759ed54c87e5b9ab633a5e48b\\\\session-38de08c8-ce10-40c6-85e2-cdb18625030a\\\\.weftmate-web-sources\\\\capture-940f3efe-be37-46c7-ada1-7bdd29c44f23.txt\"}"
